# Locutus of Borg (3/3): an artifact creature, so it has its own granted trigger (CR 613.1f): it hits Bot2 for 3 on
# turn 3. Lifelink (CR 702.15a) gains Bot1 3 (at 23), and "Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player,
# create a 1/1 colorless Borg artifact creature token" makes exactly one Borg: a 1/1 colorless Borg artifact, and no
# second token. One more or less would fail a life total or a token line.

